@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Iniciar sesión con el administrador inicial
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"admin@sistemariego.local","password":"{{ADMIN_PASSWORD}}"}

### Registrar operador
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"operador@sistemariego.local","password":"Operador123!","fullName":"Operador de campo"}

### Solicitar recuperación
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"operador@sistemariego.local"}
